---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'

const form = 'https://app.youform.com/forms/dyhjikit'
---
<Base title="Contact" description="Send feedback, ask a question, or get in touch with the people behind Hexbot.">
  <article class="prose mx-auto px-5 py-12 sm:px-8 lg:py-20">
    <h1 class="display-sm">Contact</h1>
    <p>Tell us what works, what doesn't, and what you want Hexbot to do next. For bugs, <a href="https://github.com/The1UNeed/hexbot/issues">GitHub Issues</a> is fastest; include the nightly version from Settings, About. You can also email <a href="mailto:alex.xinliu@hotmail.com">alex.xinliu@hotmail.com</a>.</p>
    <iframe src={form} title="Feedback and contact form" class="mt-8 h-[760px] w-full rounded-[20px] border border-line"></iframe>
    <p class="text-mute">Form not loading? <a href={form}>Open it in a new tab</a>.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
